        ":question/problem": "![](images/4e/4efe76bd06d22c5735b427c150f5a09b7288f8281b90921aeb11902c864176e5.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the ellipse shown above.",
